Hi all,

I'm trying to load an unmarked frame that has a lot of blanks for biological data but all cells filled for hydrological parameters.  It is a 37-year dataset with 137 sites.  I get this consistent error message as indicated in the subject when I try to fit models using the colext function in unmarked, except for the model with just "Q" for detection probability.  Does this error simply mean that I need to standardize my covariates?  I've had trouble with that, as well.

Below is my unmarked frame and colext function commands.

Thank you for any help/advice.

Cheers,

John

