Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/unmarked/c/vwJjWsxVAek/m/MVG-M3CIY_gJ>
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Hi Alejandro,

It should work. Just be aware that if you don't have many sites with multiple years of data, you won't be able to estimate gamma and omega very well.

Richard

