Subject: Workshop announcement: Bayesian population analysis using BUGS and JAGS, 13-17 January 2014, Zurich Switzerland
Message-ID: <pChBoylOxjc.kGppCsHKiq4J@unmarked.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/unmarked/c/pChBoylOxjc/m/kGppCsHKiq4J>
